  "notes": [
    "unsupported is the static list for the whole module, so it is the same in both runs.",
    "ExportReport: under On Error Resume Next every unsupported statement is recorded as an 'unsupported' trace event and skipped, so A2 and A3 are still written; status is 'partly resurrected' because the trace has unsupported events.",
